  "bio": "Matthew Gordon is a highly skilled, veteran tattoo artist who specializes in Japanese, Traditional, and Neo-traditional styles. Based out of Bordeaux, France, he is not just a tattooist but also the successful owner of Promises Kept Tattoo in Rockhampton, QLD, Australia. Exceptionally neat and keeping up the highest standards of cleanliness, he ensures both his workplaces have stellar hygiene practices.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Bordeaux, Nouvelle-aquitaine, France",
